  "openDecisions": [
    "NID Press sits under /academics on the live site but belongs to Research & Publications.",
    "Academic Notifications sits under /academics but belongs to Study at NID.",
    "The Knowledge Management Centre sits under /academics but is a top-level section in the architecture.",
    "Charter has no live page; the content that answers to it is Mandate. One page or two?",
    "Director's Message is live but absent from the architecture.",
    "Continuing Education Programme is live but absent from the architecture, and it absorbs what the architecture calls Industry & Online Programmes.",
    "Do the four faculty indexes remain four pages, or become one page with a filter? The model supports either; the URLs differ.",
    "Does the site need Hindi alongside English? The logo is bilingual, nothing else is. Retrofitting localisation after launch is materially harder than allowing for it now."
  ],
  "redirects": {
    "rule": "Store a redirect from the old path whenever a slug changes. The site is old enough that inbound links exist for most of it. Renaming a parent moves its whole subtree."
  }
